                          <TARGET-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF DEST="VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE">/Interfaces/IF_Charge_Status_SR/IF_Charge_Status_SR/ChargeCurrentSetpoint</TARGET-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF>
